ScoutCoder=/$PWD filter="*.rb *.md *.rake Rakefile *.rdoc *.R *.sh *.js *.haml *.sass *.txt *.conf *.slim *.haml" {
 README.md
 workflow.rb
 start_chat
 chats=chats filter="*"{
  delete
  workflow
  claude

  implement

  version_2

  version_2.task_doc
  version_2.task_doc.analyze

  version_2.helpers
  version_2.entities
  version_2.python

  version_2.current
  version_2.current.analyze

  version_2.folder

  path
  path.documentation
  path.path_kind_documentation

  path_testing

  path_python_task

  path_probe

  refactor

  entity_case

  skills

 }
 lib=lib {
  scout=scout{
   llm=llm{
    text_edit.rb
   }
  }
  ScoutCoder=ScoutCoder{
   helper_test_support.rb
   path_kinds.rb
   python_task_support.rb
   task_test_support.rb
   test_file_support.rb
   path_kinds=path_kinds{
    entity.rb
    entity_property.rb
    support.rb
    task.rb
    test_file.rb
			}
   tasks=tasks{
    document_task.rb
    documentation.rb
    entity_tools.rb
    list_entities.rb
    reload_workflow.rb
    workflow_tools.rb
   }
  }
 }
 share=share{
  tasks=tasks{
  }
 }

 doc=doc {
  developer=developer {
   Layout.md
   LiveWorkflow.md
   PathKindsInternals.md
   PropertyDispatch.md
   README.md
   Testing.md
  }
  user=user {
   AuthoringEntities.md
   Documentation.md
   PathKinds.md
   README.md
   Testing.md
   ToolSelection.md
  }
 }

 skills=skills {
  scoutcoder-entity-authoring=scoutcoder-entity-authoring {
   SKILL.md
  }
  scoutcoder-help-discovery=scoutcoder-help-discovery {
   SKILL.md
  }
  scoutcoder-path-kinds-lifecycle=scoutcoder-path-kinds-lifecycle {
   SKILL.md
  }
  scoutcoder-repo-documentation=scoutcoder-repo-documentation {
   SKILL.md
   workflow-readme.md
  }
 }

 bin=bin{
